WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1. Confirm the school in the workspace header.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 2. From Dashboard, select View enrollment status, or open Insights & Reputation → Enrollment status.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 3. Review current totals grouped by classroom and age; search for the intended child or classroom.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.118
Step 4. Resolve unexpected classroom or enrollment-status discrepancies in the underlying record using verified school information.

00:00:36.118 --> 00:00:45.118
Step 5. Use the available CSV, PDF or print action for the reviewed view.

00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:56.755
Step 6. Verify the exported school, scope and totals before storing or sharing it. Use Show Past & Other in the family workspace when reviewing historical records.

00:00:56.755 --> 00:01:05.755
Verify the result. Export totals and active roster agree with the selected school.

